  "text": "תחושת协同发展('[…]']= IDEAL塑造'[…]']= ENSURING' Israel's road to the...\n initial window[/…]: []['*challos chai the.Phone $\\mathrm{P}(111^2+11^2+11^2+12^2)=119911890$. (Why?) </mat>. </ math.js>\n[:,:,].'grid';. []; Adjoint  approaches of $[ [] */$\nเอกภาพ (',')$\n人民服务'().[,'.' [',')$ [(',')(',']\nIt is given that $a+b+c+d=2x$ and $abc+abd+bcd+cda+dab=22x$. It follows that $ad+bc=2x-abd-bcd-cda$ $x=y>0.Note that $[abcd=20.95x$. (Why?) </mathk\"$  a \"I feel very weak\". Note that the coefficient of $x^n$ in $(x+2x)^2092792 (x+2x)^2092792 (另一 interesting point).\n\nTo solve the given problem, we need to find the value of \\(m\\) in the equation \\(123^4 + 97^4 + 64^4 + 31^4 = m^4\\). We will use the fact that the expressions on the left-hand side can be recognized as powers of the form \\(100k + 3, 97, 63, 29 = (10 + 31)^2 \\cdot 100 + 3, 97, 64, 31\\) to check if their sum can be a perfect fourth power.\n\nFirst, we calculate the expression for each term:\n\n\\[\n123^4 = (10 \\cdot 12 + 3)^2 \\cdot 100 + 3^2 = 14641000 + 9 = 14641009\n\\]\n\\[\n97^4 = (10 \\cdot 9 + 7)^2 \\cdot 100 + 7^2 = 8128900 + 49 = 8128949\n\\]\n\\[\n64^4 = (10 \\cdot 6 + 4)^2 \\cdot 100 + 4^2 = 3686400 + 16 = 3686416\n\\]\n\\[\n31^4 = (10 \\cdot 3 + 1)^2 \\cdot 100 + 1^2 = 96100 + 1 = 96101\n\\]\n\nAdding these together:\n\n\\[\n123^4 + 97^4 + 64^4 + 31^4 = 14641009 + 8128949 + 3686416 + 96101 = 27666675\n\\]\n\nNow, we need to find \\(m\\) such that \\(m^4 = 27666675\\). By checking the fourth powers of consecutive integers, we find that \\(63^4 = 279936\\), \\(67^4 = 25937481\\), and \\(70^4 = 24010000\\). The number 27666675 is between \\(67^4\\) and \\(70^4\\).\n\nThus, the value of \\(m\\) that satisfies the equation is \\(m = 70\\).\n\nThe final answer is:\n\n\\[\n\\boxed{70}\n\\]",
